    {
      "id": 101402,
      "type": "Skill",
      "name": { "en": "Strike Air: Hammer of the Wind King", "zh-CN": "风王铁槌" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Deals Wind DMG equal to #1[i]% of Saber's ATK to one designated enemy, and deals Wind DMG equal to #2[i]% of Saber's ATK to adjacent targets. If Saber currently holds \"Core Resonance\" and her Energy can be fully regenerated by consuming \"Core Resonance\" after this instance of Skill attack, then increases the multiplier for this instance of Skill. For every 1 point of \"Core Resonance,\" increases the DMG multiplier for this instance of Skill by #4[f1]%. And after the attack, consumes all \"Core Resonance\" to regenerate Energy for Saber. Otherwise, immediately gains #3[i] point(s) of \"Core Resonance.\"",
        "zh-CN": "对指定敌方单体造成等同于Saber#1[i]%攻击力的风属性伤害，对相邻目标造成等同于Saber#2[i]%攻击力的风属性伤害。若当前持有【炉心共鸣】，且本次战技攻击后消耗【炉心共鸣】可为Saber恢复满能量，则使本次战技倍率提高，每有1点【炉心共鸣】使本次战技的伤害倍率提高#4[f1]%，并在攻击后消耗所有【炉心共鸣】为Saber恢复能量，否则立即获得#3[i]点【炉心共鸣】。"
      },
